# Flutter development — rule index

This file is a **pure index**. All enforceable rules live in the files listed below.
Do not add rules here — add them to the appropriate file.

---

## State management
→ **`bloc-patterns.mdc`**
BLoC vs Cubit decision, event/state design, `response_type` branching, `BlocBuilder` vs `BlocListener`, `AppToast`, immutability, `copyWith`, emit rules.

## Layer boundaries
→ **`repository-boundaries.mdc`**
What belongs in repository vs BLoC vs view. `ApiService`-only access in repos. Error mapping. No `response_type` branching in repos.

## Error handling and retries
→ **`error-handling.mdc`**
Typed failures/results, user-facing error messages, retry policy, toast guard for empty message, unauthorized redirect, and cancellation with `CancelToken`.

## Routing
→ **`routing-conventions.mdc`**
`RouteNames`, `AppRoutes`, `AppRouter`. `BlocProvider` in route builders. No navigation logic inside BLoC.

## Models & serialization
→ **`model-serialization.mdc`**
`fromJson` / `toJson` mirroring. Null-safe parsing patterns. DTO placement. `copyWith` + immutability. Freezed models: do not manually write serialization.

## Assets, strings, colors, fonts
→ **`flutter-assets.mdc`**
`AppAssets`, `AppStrings`, `AppColors`, `AppFonts`. One constant per literal — no duplicates.

## Environment & URLs
→ **`environment-urls.mdc`**
No hardcoded URLs. `UrlService` as single access point. `AppConfig` for environment switching. No `dotenv` in feature code.

## Widget hygiene
→ **`avoid-unnecessary-material.mdc`**
Use `Material` only when ink / elevation / clip behavior is required. Default to `Container`, `ColoredBox`, `SizedBox`, `DecoratedBox`.

## General conventions
→ **`general.mdc`**
No duplication. Prefer reuse. Consistent naming. `snake_case` files.

## Error handling
→ **`error-handling.mdc`**
Typed failures, failure-to-message mapping, toast behavior,
retry logic, cancellation, unauthorized redirect.

